description:
markdown-table-repair: Markdown Table Repair API: turns a broken table, tab-separated text or an HTML table into a GFM table without changing any cell - alignment row, pipes, escaped pipes, padded rows; 007 and 1.10 stay as written. No language model. $0.003 USDC per call (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"input": "string, required - up to 60000 chars"}
